# Filters the context that azd uploads to ACR Tasks (docker.remoteBuild in deployment/azure.yaml).
# The context is this whole folder, so keep azd environment files (.env holds deployment
# outputs), local tooling and docs out of the uploaded archive.
**/.azure
**/.env
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.vscode
deployment
howto
src/tests
*.md
